</div>";s:16:"quickstart_title";s:11:"Quick Start";s:15:"region-side-pre";s:5:"Right";s:22:"settings_accessibility";s:28:"Enable accessibility options";s:27:"settings_accessibility_desc";s:120:"Allows customization of options to improve platform accessibility, such as contrast, font size, and keyboard navigation.";s:30:"settings_accessibility_heading";s:13:"Accessibility";s:27:"settings_icons_change_icons";s:42:"Change the default icon in the course list";s:25:"settings_icons_color_icon";s:32:"Set a custom color for the icon.";s:30:"settings_icons_color_icon_desc";s:116:"Select the background color for the icon displayed in the course list. Leave blank to use the theme's default color.";s:26:"settings_icons_upload_icon";s:23:"Upload the custom icon.";s:27:"settings_icons_upload_image";s:11:"Block Image";s:32:"settings_icons_upload_image_desc";s:152:"If an image is provided, the theme will convert the module row into a block, using the image as its background. The image must have a 16:9 aspect ratio.";s:10:"showfooter";s:11:"Show footer";s:11:"svg_animate";s:39:"Use animated SVG in default image icons";s:16:"svg_animate_desc";s:150:"Enable this option to display default image icons with SVG animations. This can enhance visual appearance but may affect performance on older devices.";s:19:"userprofilesettings";s:12:"User Profile";}